# masks_and_meshes.png, rendered by the stock engine's flutter_tester with
# Impeller, against fl-engine's frame through emblema, both at DPR 2.
# Percent of pixels allowed to differ in any channel, and by more than 32.
#
# ShaderMask, gradient and image shaders in the blend modes a mask is used
# in, and drawVertices: each mode, indexed, colors under four blend modes,
# a gradient and an image at texture coordinates, a paint's alpha. What
# differs is a level or two wherever a gradient is dithered, and a few
# pixels at one mask's corner. Measured 2026-11-20, lavapipe: 9.965%
# differ, 0.002% by more than 32.
differ 12.0
differ_over_32 0.05
